 off monsters that strayed too close to the city.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_251"],["say","avg1_162","A month ago, that peace was shattered.==W== A young girl vanished from her home,==W== and despite all the searching her family and I did, we found no trace of her.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.3],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["film",0],["bg","phylanis_street_inside_night",0,0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",7.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_168","a","002",0.5,-0.25,1.4,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.97,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["say","avg1_162","At first, I thought she might have fallen into the water and been swept away from Filanis.==W== But then...==W==",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.7],["goon"],["show","avg3_170","a","002",0.5,-0.2,1.4,0,null,0.0],["cbg",0,50.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_170","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,0.97,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["se","se_227"],["say","avg1_162","A week later, a second child disappeared,==W== this time outside Filanis.==W== According to the family, the child had only gone out to buy bread and never came back.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["goon"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["film",1],["bg","phylanis_street_outside_daylight",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.3],["hide","avg3_168",0.3],["ctl","avg3_170","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.3],["hide","avg3_170",0.3],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_162","All Filanian children know how to swim, so the odds of two of them accidentally falling into the water were far too low. Lulu and I searched every cellar and abandoned house in Filanis, but found nothing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Kidnapping? But no one ever came to demand a ransom. Could it have been trafficking?",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_162","That was my thought as well, so I widened the search and kept a close watch on foreign travelers. Around the same time, rumors of the Fallen Saintess began to spread.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_226"],["cbg",0,null,null,0.98,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,-100.0,1.35,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_162","Many people were convinced the Fallen Saintess had slipped into Filanis==W== and taken those poor children away to devour them.",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["show","avg3_182","b","024",0.27,-0.45,1.4,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,-0.25,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,0.52,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["stg",0,170.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_070"],["bgm",""],["say","avg3_182","Come on, ==W==no matter how wicked the Fallen Saintess is supposed to be,==W== she wouldn't eat children!",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","OutQuint",1.0],["bgm","m62"],["say","avg1_162","Of course, it was a ridiculous rumor. In fact...==W== I don't believe the Fallen Saintess was responsible for those crimes,==W== or for any of those deaths.",0,""],["w",1.2],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a",nu