 their way. I feared they might be hiding the kidnapped children there, so I sent Lulu back to the city and drove one of the prison wagons to the tower myself...==W== And that's where I ran into you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_tower_gate_daylight",0,0.8],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm","m149"],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_182","b","015",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","015",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","So that's what happened. You'd just taken down a group of slavers, and they were spreading rumors about the Fallen Saintess. Then you saw me, looking just like the wanted sketch, so of course your mind went there. Totally makes sense.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","011",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","011",null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Actually... I never really thought you were the Fallen Saintess. For one, you don't have the eyes of someone who's killed before. And for another, I've always believed the Fallen Saintess was just a figure exaggerated by rumor.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I only said it to see how you'd react...==W== Just a little trick we Night Watchers use when questioning thieves: start with a bigger accusation and see if they flinch.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_030"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","002",null,0.2,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","002","question",0.25,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Then what did you think I'd done?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","That you might've been working with the slavers. Or maybe ... a grave robber.",0,""],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["se","se_070"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","016",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-100.0,-30.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_182","b","020","resentful",0.4,null,null,null,"jushou2","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Hey, come on, use your eyes!==W== I'm this cute and charming, and you thought I was a slaver or a grave robber?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","011","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Uh... Because you were standing next to an absurdly lavish coffin, and inside was the breathless ==PLAYER_NAME==.",0,""],["bg","phylanis_prisonvan_dusk",5,0.0],["cbg",5,-600.0,810.0,1.43,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","circle_light",5,0.0],["cbg",5,null,null,2.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","Yeah, I can see how that would've looked like grave robbing. Heh.==W== So you threw both me and the coffin into the wagon as evidence of Elis's \"crime.\"",1,""],["w",0.7],["stage",5,0,14],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["stage",5,1,15],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","That's right. I'm sorry...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No need to apologize. In that state, anyone would've thought I was a corpse.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So that's why your attitude changed later... I \"came back to life,\" and Elis protected me on her own. Which meant she couldn't have been a grave robber, or a slaver.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,0.3,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["hide","avg3_182",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Right. But I still had doubts about who you really were...==W== So I brought you back to Filanis.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","And that's because...?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Elis acted perfectly natural for a slave. But you, as her master...==W== You had none of that air of superiority. And the way you treated her wasn't like a slave at all. It was more like ...==W== a friend.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_030"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",1.0],["se","se_054"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","flurry",null],["say","avg3_100","R-Really...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","phylanis_prisonvan_dusk",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_182","b","021",0.5,-0.35,1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","021","music",null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","(I'll keep playing your slave.==W== But seriously, be a bit more ruthless with me. Show some authority! Nobody treats a slave as gently as you do.)",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","sigh","chijing"],["say","avg3_100","Elis did warn me about that, but I just couldn't do it... No matter how hard I try, I can't treat a living person like a slave.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","So I started to wonder if maybe both of you were slaves. The high-ranking kind, the ones who serve Archons or Demigods.==W== You escaped together, and pretending to be master and slave was simply the easiest cover.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So...==W== You brought us to Filanis to protect us, and to help us start over there with new identities.",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_029"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Yes. If Archon Olympia discovered you were slaves, she would most likely set you free.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.0],["bg","mood_4",0,0.5],["show","avg3_182","b","015",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","015","awkward",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","You're almost so kind it doesn't even feel real.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","004","question",0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Your Patron Olympia, ruler of Filanis, may forbid the people of Filanis from keeping slaves, but that doesn't mean you have to leave the city and rescue slaves out in the wilds, does it? Wouldn't that just bring trouble to her?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Archon Olympia always said that anyone who steps into Filanis should do so as a free person. She supports us in freeing slaves by peaceful means whenever possible, and punishing those who profit from selling them.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","And ... I used to be a slave too. I know what it feels like to be treated like an object. So I'll help you however I can.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["hide","avg3_182",0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022","vexation",0.5,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["say","avg1_162","... Why do slaves even exist? Why can't people just live peacefully together?",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["bg","mood_3",5,0.0],["show","avg3_182","a","002",null,null,null,5,null,1.0],["se","se_055"],["stage",5,0,0],["say","avg3_182","Of course it's because...==W== Everyone has wishes they want fulfilled, and some people can only get what they want by sacrificing others.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","005","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stage",5,0,8],["ctl","avg3_182","b","020","resentful",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Hmph, don't go thinking everyone is as naive as you two idiots. You keep being this gullible, and one day it'll get you killed.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,1],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Thanks for the warning.==W== But...==W== After you tried to escape from the bathhouse and Saintess Leita caught you, I started to rethink who you really were. You probably aren't slaves.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",1.0],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["bg","phylanis_street_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["show","avg3_182","c","011",0.6,0.0,1.0,0,null,1.0],["show","avg3_225","a","005",0.4,null,1.05,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_182","b","002",0.5,0.0,1.0,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,"attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-60.0,1.3,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["chd",0,4,"avg1_162","a","007",null],["say","avg1_162","Elis, you're the runaway Saintess, aren't you? And ==PLAYER_NAME== is a noble of some standing who, for reasons I don't know, chose to help you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["chd",1,4,"avg1_162","a","002",null],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg3_182","b","016",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm","m148"],["say","avg3_182","Huh!? What nonsense are you talking about? How could I possibly be a Saintess?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","That's a pretty sharp guess. No wonder she is a Night Watcher... Aside from one thing she couldn't possibly know, that I'm from another world, she's basically right.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.1,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.3],["show","avg1_162","a","002",null,-0.25,1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003","speechless",null,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","When Saintess Leita was trying to determine who you were... She looked like she recognized you, and even deliberately helped cover for you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["trn",0,1,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_street_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["show","avg3_225","a","007",0.4,0.0,1.05,0,null,1.0],["show","avg3_182","c","027",0.58,0.0,null,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_225","a","009","music",0.42,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","c","015",null,0.61,null,null,null,"jingxia2","OutQuart",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Normally... An innocent person would have no reason to flee through the sewers like that. But when it came to you hiding under the carriage, she brushed it off by mocking you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_162","So I looked into it...==W== Into Saintess Leita's past before she became a true Saintess, and found that she was from the same class as the runaway Saintess.",0,""],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_flash_light",0,0],["goon"],["say","avg1_162","Everyone in that class had a clear record, except for the runaway Saintess. None of the others could possibly have ended up in Filanis as a slave,==W== which leaves only one possibility...",0,""],["w",1],["show","avg3_182","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_182","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.2,"OutCubic",2.0,null,null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","023","flurry",null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_182","Even if I did know that Saintess, it doesn't prove anything...==W== We didn't have to meet during training. Maybe we were just neighbors back in Emor...==W== Yeah, neighbors!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","027",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","024","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","002",0.75,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"question",0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_162","How could a Saintess possibly be neighbors with a slave? If you're saying she was neighbors with ==PLAYER_NAME== instead, then at the bathhouse...==W== Saintess Leita looked like she didn't know ==PLAYER_NAME== at all.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_257"],["stg",0,70.0,-100.0,1.4,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_182","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005",null,0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_182","b","026","flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_182","I... I can explain that too...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Elis, stop struggling.==W== I think Alina isn't saying all this to turn us in. After all, she never brought up any of these doubts during the bathhouse test.",1,""],["bgm",""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_182","b","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Archon Olympia has never issued a warrant for the runaway Saintess in Filanis. Lord Coppelius once told me that he didn't believe the runaway Saintess did anything wrong.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],